he mxfp4/MoE\narea: no open PR addresses this error-message issue. (#63349 refactors the MoE\noracle selection but does not change this message; happy to rebase on it.)\n\n## AI assistance\n\nAI assistance was used to author this change. The submitter reviewed every\nchanged line, understands and can defend it end-to-end, and ran the validation\ncommands above.\n",
